+<dialog id="signup" aria-labelledby="signup-title" aria-describedby="signup-description"><button class="dialog-close" aria-label="关闭注册窗口">×</button><div class="eyebrow">新的开始，一起记账</div><h2 class="dialog-title" id="signup-title">创建你的团队账本</h2><p id="signup-description">当前为产品演示，填写内容不会上传，也不会创建真实账户。</p><form id="signup-form"><label>团队名称<input name="team" placeholder="例如：山间设计工作室" maxlength="30" required autocomplete="organization"></label><label>电子邮箱<input name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required autocomplete="email"></label><button class="btn" type="submit">创建演示账本 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></form><p class="form-message" id="form-message" role="status" hidden></p></dialog>
