+    <div class="section-top"><div><div class="section-tag">简单够用，刚刚好</div><h2 id="features-title">把复杂的账，变成顺手的事。</h2></div><p class="section-intro">不必成为财务专家。<br>从记下第一笔，到看清每一步，合账陪你一起。</p></div>
+    <div class="feature-grid">
+      <article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-number">01 / RECORD</span><div class="feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="3" width="14" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M9 8h6M9 12h6M9 16h3M3 7h4M3 12h4M3 17h4"/></svg></div><h3>随手一记，不漏一笔</h3><p>收入、支出、票据，集中收好。按项目和类别整理，告别月底翻找聊天记录。</p><div class="feature-detail"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span> 收支分类 <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> 票据归档 <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> 项目账本</div></article>
+      <article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-number">02 / TOGETHER</span><div class="feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3"/><path d="M3 21v-3a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v3M16 5a3 3 0 0 1 0 6m1 4a5 5 0 0 1 4 5"/></svg></div><h3>一本账，大家心里有数</h3><p>邀请伙伴共同记账，按角色分配权限。谁记的、花在哪，清清楚楚，不用反复问。</p><div class="feature-detail"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span> 多人协作 <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> 成员权限 <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> 操作留痕</div></article>
+      <article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-number">03 / INSIGHT</span><div class="feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 3v17h17M9 16v-5m5 5V7m5 9V4"/></svg></div><h3>经营好不好，一眼知道</h3><p>收支自动汇总，趋势清晰呈现。少一点猜测，多一点把握，让下一步更有方向。</p><div class="feature-detail"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span> 收支报表 <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> 经营趋势 <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> 数据导出</div></article>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+  <section class="testimonials" id="stories" aria-labelledby="stories-title"><div class="wrap section">
+    <div class="section-top testimonial-top"><div><div class="section-tag">一起经营，一起成长</div><h2 id="stories-title">省下的时间，留给更重要的事。</h2></div><p class="sample-note">以下为典型使用场景的示例评价</p></div>
+    <div class="quote-grid">
+      <article class="quote-card"><div class="quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</div><blockquote>以前每到月底就头疼，几个表格来回对。现在项目赚了多少、还有多少没收回，打开账本就知道。</blockquote><div class="quote-author"><span class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">林</span><div><strong>林小满</strong><p>设计工作室主理人 · 5 人团队</p></div></div></article>
+      <article class="quote-card"><div class="quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</div><blockquote>合伙开店最怕账不清楚。现在我们各自记、一起看，每一笔都有记录，沟通也轻松了很多。</blockquote><div class="quote-author"><span class="avatar" style="background:#d9e2d2" aria-hidden="true">周</span><div><strong>周以安</strong><p>咖啡店合伙人 · 3 人团队</p></div></div></article>
+      <article class="quote-card"><div class="quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</div><blockquote>没有复杂到看不懂的功能，就是一本顺手的账。把琐碎的事理顺了，才能安心把作品做好。</blockquote><div class="quote-author"><span class="avatar" style="background:#e7dcd0" aria-hidden="true">陈</span><div><strong>陈一禾</strong><p>内容创作者 · 2 人团队</p></div></div></article>
+    </div>
+  </div></section>
+  <section class="wrap cta" id="start" aria-labelledby="start-title"><div class="cta-inner"><div><h2 id="start-title">好生意，从一本清楚的账开始。</h2><p>带上你的伙伴，让每一笔收支都有着落。</p></div><div class="cta-action"><button class="btn" data-register>免费开启团队账本 <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><p>简单开始，从容经营</p></div></div></section>
+</main>
+<footer class="site-footer"><div class="wrap"><div class="footer-inner"><div class="footer-brand"><a class="brand" href="#"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none"><path d="M7 6v16m7-19v19m7-13v13M4 17h20" stroke="#e8efce" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span>合账</a><p>小团队的每一笔，都算数。</p></div><div class="footer-links"><a href="#features">产品功能</a><a href="#stories">用户评价</a><button class="text-button" style="font-size:12px;padding:0" data-register>开启账本 ↗</button></div></div><p class="copyright">© 2026 合账 Hezhang · 为认真经营的你而做</p></div></footer>
+<dialog id="signup" aria-labelledby="signup-title" aria-describedby="signup-description"><button class="dialog-close" aria-label="关闭注册窗口">×</button><div class="eyebrow">新的开始，一起记账</div><h2 class="dialog-title" id="signup-title">创建你的团队账本</h2><p id="signup-description">当前为产品演示，填写内容不会上传，也不会创建真实账户。</p><form id="signup-form"><label>团队名称<input name="team" placeholder="例如：山间设计工作室" maxlength="30" required autocomplete="organization"></label><label>电子邮箱<input name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required autocomplete="email"></label><button class="btn" type="submit">创建演示账本 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></form><p class="form-message" id="form-message" role="status" hidden></p></dialog>
+<script>
+  const dialog = document.querySelector('#signup');
+  const form = document.querySelector('#signup-form');
+  const message = document.querySelector('#form-message');
+  let opener;
+  document.querySelectorAll('[data-register]').forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => {
+    opener = button; form.hidden = false; form.style.display = ''; message.hidden = true;
+    dialog.showModal();
+  }));
+  document.querySelector('.dialog-close').addEventListener('click', () => dialog.close());
+  dialog.addEventListener('click', event => { if(event.target === dialog) { const box = dialog.getBoundingClientRect(); if(event.clientX < box.left || event.clientX > box.right || event.clientY < box.top || event.clientY > box.bottom) dialog.close(); }});
+  dialog.addEventListener('close', () => { form.reset(); opener?.focus(); });
+  form.addEventListener('submit', event => {
+    event.preventDefault();
+    const team = form.elements.team.value.trim();
+    if(!team) { form.elements.team.setCustomValidity('请输入团队名称'); form.elements.team.reportValidity(); return; }
+    message.textContent = `“${team}”的演示账本已准备好。你可以关闭窗口，切换首页预览的月份，了解收支概览。正式注册功能尚未接入。`;
+    form.style.display = 'none'; message.hidden = false;
+  });
+  form.elements.team.addEventListener('input', () => form.elements.team.setCustomValidity(''));
+  document.querySelectorAll('[data-preview]').forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => {
+    const dashboard = document.querySelector('.dashboard');
+    document.querySelector('#preview').scrollIntoView({behavior:matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches?'instant':'smooth',block:'center'});
+    dashboard.focus({preventScroll:true}); dashboard.classList.add('highlight');
+    setTimeout(() => dashboard.classList.remove('highlight'), 2200);
+  }));
+  document.querySelector('#month').addEventListener('change', event => {
+    const june = event.target.value === '6';
+    const values = june ? ['¥ 86,500','¥ 32,680','¥ 53,820','↗ 18.6%','共 24 笔支出'] : ['¥ 72,934','¥ 29,150','¥ 43,784','↗ 12.3%','共 21 笔支出'];
+    ['income','expense','balance','growth','expense-count'].forEach((id,i) => document.getElementById(id).textContent = values[i]);
+    const path = june ? 'M35 104C60 104 75 82 100 85S135 98 160 73S200 83 230 57S269 69 295 43S330 55 355 33S404 36 433 17' : 'M35 110C60 108 75 95 100 98S135 87 160 89S200 65 230 70S269 61 295 65S330 43 355 47S404 28 433 31';
+    document.querySelector('#income-line').setAttribute('d',path);
+    document.querySelector('#area').setAttribute('d',path+'V117H35Z');
+  });
+</script>
+</body>
+</html>

